{{JPExclusive}}
{{Unobtainable}}
'''Toy Machine Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be unlocked by inputting 3 [[Main Menu#Presents For Friends Invitation|serial codes]] from The Battle Cats [[wikipedia:Gashapon|gashapon]] machine which are only found in Japan. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. It is now unobtainable due to the fact that serial codes can no longer be input to the game. This unit is, however, obtainable on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch version]] when rolling the [[Cat Capsule]] 30 times then winning any stage in-game.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 62
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Toy Machine Cat
|name2 = Vendor Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Vendor Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Like most special meatshields, this one isn't very good. Low damage and low health, tries to act like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] but has half the stats. Therefore, it should only should be used as a filler meatshield when there aren't any others, as 75円 meatshields generally perform better.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

